Apply factor and offset: Physical = (Raw * Factor) + Offset

```c
on message 0x100 {
  // Raw sensor value
  byte raw_temp = this.data[0];

  // Apply scaling: physical = (raw * 0.5) - 40
  float physical_temp = (raw_temp * 0.5) - 40.0;

  write("Raw: %d, Physical: %f °C", raw_temp, physical_temp);

  // Reverse scaling for transmission
  byte raw_to_send = (int)((physical_temp + 40.0) / 0.5);
  write("Calculated raw: %d", raw_to_send);
}
```

Combine bytes using bit shifting and OR operations to reconstruct multi-byte values.

```c
on message 0x100 {
  // 16-bit value at bytes 0-1 (Intel byte order)
  word value_16bit = this.data[0] | (this.data[1] << 8);

  // 32-bit value at bytes 0-3
  dword value_32bit = this.data[0] | 
                     (this.data[1] << 8) | 
                     (this.data[2] << 16) | 
                     (this.data[3] << 24);

  // Motorola byte order (big-endian) 16-bit
  word motorola_16 = (this.data[0] << 8) | this.data[1];

  write("16-bit: %d, 32-bit: %ld, Motorola: %d", 
        value_16bit, value_32bit, motorola_16);
}
```

